  "id": "aggressive-character",
  "term": "aggressive character",
  "definition": "In this biological context, aggressive character means a tumor behaves in a more harmful and fast-progressing way, with greater tendency to worsen, recur, and be linked to shorter survival. In the source, it refers especially to glioblastoma’s severe disease course and poor prognosis.",
